stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Router
    Router --> Retrieve: route is rag
    Router --> Generate: route is general
    Retrieve --> Generate: context attached to state
    Generate --> Critique: draft_answer produced
    Critique --> [*]: route is general critique skipped
    Critique --> Refine: unsupported claims detected
    Critique --> [*]: answer well-grounded
    Refine --> [*]: final_answer rewritten

    note right of Router
        Classifies question as
        needing document retrieval
        vs general conversation
    end note

    note right of Retrieve
        Query rewriter resolves
        follow-up pronouns before
        similarity search runs
    end note

    note right of Critique
        Self-checks draft against
        retrieved context for
        unsupported claims
    end note